<title>USA: Westhampton Beach UFSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>Westhampton Beach UFSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross Inc. said it won $5.913 million of Westhampton Beach UFSD, N.Y., school district bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.08 percent.</p>
</text>
